OL,3,GNEWSAWhy has a plan for 47,000 homes
OL,4,Abeen so controversial?
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for thousands of new homes have
OL,7,Ffaced protests and now a government
OL,8,Fintervention.
OL,10,FThe proposals are part of West
OL,11,FNorthamptonshire Council's draft Local
OL,12,FPlan, which could see up to 47,300 new
OL,13,Fhomes built across the region by 2043.
OL,15,FBut after protests, petitions, changes
OL,16,Fand being rejected the government has
OL,17,Fstepped in.
OL,19,FWhy has this local plan caused so many
OL,20,Fissues?
